#. Diagram label
msgid "A detangled, isolated graph"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:34
#. Diagram label
msgid "Build pipeline"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:126
#. Diagram label
msgid "closed"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:95
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Copy the content and the tools alone into a temporary directory, with nothing else on the path, and run the tools' checks there. An empty tree must exit non-zero, so a rehearsal over nothing cannot pass."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:117
#. Diagram label
msgid "Could not run"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:133
#. Diagram label
msgid "could not run"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:65
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Create <name>-tools as a sibling directory and move the code: the Zod source, the generators, the README and diagram writers, the content checks. Cut its import cone to its own files and declared packages. Both start at the content's version."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:89
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Decided by `check:node-iris`: a published node's own identifier ($id or @id) under the release address must be its file's path. A mismatch goes back to the plan: move the file, or change the identifier before it is ever served."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:74
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Decided by commands, not judgement: `check:tools-closure` (no import leaves the tools directory or names an undeclared package), the content's no-code test, and generated files byte-identical before and after the move. Any failure goes back to the split."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:88
#. Diagram label
msgid "Every identifier its file's path?"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:80
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Every identifier the content mints is a file some step publishes: /v<major>/, for what programs read and pages people read alike; the exact release is the pin's. Name collisions between published files are resolved here."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:129
#. Diagram label
msgid "every one matches"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:18
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Gets a detangled graph ready to stand alone: its identity, the harness output about it moved to the host, its content split from its tools, its publication planned, and a standalone rehearsal. Each gateway is a command; a check that could not run ends the phase rather than reading as clean. Called by kg-separation (bpmn-authoring: split by phase)."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:131
#. Diagram label
msgid "green"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:109
#. Diagram label
msgid "Green alone"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:102
#. Diagram label
msgid "Green alone?"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:103
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Green with nothing else present goes on. Red means an edge the earlier gates did not see, so back to detangling. If the rehearsal could not run, that is not a pass: stop."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:48
#. Diagram label
msgid "Identity: version, iriBase, nodeSchemas"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:125
#. Diagram label
msgid "leaks or stale"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:128
#. Diagram label
msgid "mismatch"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:56
#. Diagram label
msgid "Move harness output about it to the host"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:31
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owns where things are published: every identifier the content mints must be a file some step publishes, at /<version>/ for programs and /v<major>/ for people; and the first release."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:79
#. Diagram label
msgid "Plan publication"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:23
#. Diagram label
msgid "Platform authoring agent"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:15
#. Diagram label
msgid "Prepare a graph to stand alone"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:30
#. Diagram label
msgid "Publication manager"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:57
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "QA verdicts, translation templates, the exported graph and the glossary ledger are harness output ABOUT the graph: they live with the harness (kgQaHomeFor, translationsHomeFor). The content keeps only what its own checks need; the leak test's pending list is empty. The one exception is a separated layer that declares a `qa` directory of its own with `storage`: its verdicts are its own repository's, published to that repository's qa-reports branch (step 10), and read by a host at the commit it pins."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:113
#. Diagram label
msgid "Red: an unseen edge"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:132
#. Diagram label
msgid "red: an unseen edge"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:94
#. Diagram label
msgid "Rehearse standalone"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:35
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs the checks that decide the gateways: the tools' import closure and the content's lack of code, node identifiers against file paths, the standalone rehearsal, and dereferencing after release. A gate that cannot tell stops the process; it never reads as clean."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:64
#. Diagram label
msgid "Split content from tools"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:49
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The declaration carries name, version, iriBase, needs and nodeSchemas. A base move is `bun run iri:sync -- --from <old base>`, once; then `iri:sync:check` and `check:node-iris` are green."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:110
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The graph builds and checks green with nothing of its parent mounted."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:24
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The platform-side stages: the graph's identity (version, iriBase, nodeSchemas), moving harness output about it into the host, splitting the content from its tools, and making the parent consume the pair additively."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:118
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The rehearsal could not run, so nobody can tell. Not clean; the caller stops."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:114
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The rehearsal found an edge the measurement missed. The caller goes back to detangling."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-prepare.bpmn:73
#. Diagram label
msgid "Tools closed, content code-free?"
msgstr ""
